  "ghazi": {"fr": "« Guerrier, conquérant » en arabe, de la racine غزا (ghazā), « faire une incursion, attaquer ».", "en": "Means \"warrior, conqueror, raider\" in Arabic, from the root غزا (ghazā) meaning \"to raid, to attack\".", "url": "https://www.behindthename.com/name/ghazi", "refs": ["Wehr, Hans. A Dictionary of Modern Written Arabic. Spoken Language Services, 1979, page 788."]},
