  "hafiz": {"fr": "« Gardien, protecteur, conservateur » en arabe, dérivé de حفظ (ḥafiẓa), « préserver, protéger ».", "en": "Means \"preserver, guardian, keeper\" in Arabic, a derivative of حفظ (ḥafiẓa) meaning \"to preserve, to protect\".", "url": "https://www.behindthename.com/name/hafiz", "refs": ["Wehr, Hans. A Dictionary of Modern Written Arabic. Spoken Language Services, 1979, page 220."]},
