  "jamal": {"fr": "« Beauté » en arabe, de la racine جمل (jamala), « être beau ».", "en": "Means \"beauty\" in Arabic, from the root جمل (jamala) meaning \"to be beautiful\".", "url": "https://www.behindthename.com/name/jamal", "refs": ["Ahmed, Salahuddin. A Dictionary of Muslim Names. New York University, 1999, page 88.", "Wehr, Hans. A Dictionary of Modern Written Arabic. Spoken Language Services, 1979, page 162."]},
