  "khalid": {"fr": "« Éternel » en arabe, dérivé de خلد (khalada), « durer toujours ».", "en": "Means \"eternal\" in Arabic, derived from خلد (khalada) meaning \"to last forever\".", "url": "https://www.behindthename.com/name/khalid", "refs": ["Ahmed, Salahuddin. A Dictionary of Muslim Names. New York University, 1999, page 97.", "Wehr, Hans. A Dictionary of Modern Written Arabic. Spoken Language Services, 1979, page 294."]},
