  "laya": {"fr": "« Douce, délicate » en arabe, de la racine لان (lāna), « être doux ».", "en": "Means \"soft, delicate\" in Arabic, from the root لان (lāna) meaning \"to be soft\".", "url": "https://www.behindthename.com/name/layan", "refs": ["Wehr, Hans. A Dictionary of Modern Written Arabic. Spoken Language Services, 1979, page 1041."]},
