  "tariq": {"fr": "« Visiteur, celui qui frappe à la porte » en arabe, de طرق (ṭaraqa), « frapper ».", "en": "Means \"visitor, knocker at the door\" in Arabic, from طرق (ṭaraqa) meaning \"to knock\".", "url": "https://www.behindthename.com/name/tariq", "refs": ["Wehr, Hans. A Dictionary of Modern Written Arabic. Spoken Language Services, 1979, page 653."]},
